{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_title", "source_sha256": "3778f54894c4a819e2cc8cdbf2ec39aaa512a1e5626b6cc8b1a3d294c58f08b5", "ja": "ありがとう、これからも", "zh": "谢谢你，今后也请多指教", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_synopsis", "source_sha256": "922fddb851c9edaa30611370d2832598ab93aaeea1574c1741d1e7d594821704", "ja": "地方ロケ中、熱心なファンに声を掛けられる\n紗代子。「皆は何故こんな自分を好きでいて\nくれるんだろう。この気持ちに、自分は何を\n返せるだろう」紗代子はプロデューサーと\n話す事で、自分なりの答えを見つける。", "zh": "在地方出外景时，纱代子遇到了热心粉丝向她\n搭话。“大家为什么会喜欢这样的自己呢。\n面对这份心意，自己又该如何回报呢”\n纱代子通过与制作人倾谈，\n找到了属于她自己的答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "41b88507d1aef4a23f608189768be76762db5fca050527b756561792123bd149", "ja": "私のソロ、『君想いBirthday』を聴いて\nいただきました。ありがとうございました！", "zh": "您听了我的独唱曲《思念你的生日》。谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "e4e823cc9b6d126e7032620e3c7220920709d70c55c995e15d7c984bc1caaaff", "ja": "好きな人に、いつか誕生日を\nお祝いしてほしいっていう歌詞でしたけど……。", "zh": "歌词里写着“希望有朝一日，喜欢的人\n能为自己庆祝生日”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "1a435273863f47f4f62683c4cfc4d3f97ebdfa9414f439c363211400669ba193", "ja": "誰かに誕生日をお祝いしてもらえるって、\nすごいことですよね！", "zh": "能得到某个人为自己庆祝生日，真的是一件很了不起的事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "9396f593cc80fc6d3d6ac440c82b2d1e54e2f8072fa0997048f659360bcf067e", "ja": "ここにいるみなさんが、私に出会ってくれた日や、\n私を好きだと、特別だと思ってくれた日……。", "zh": "在场的各位与我相遇的那一天，以及喜欢我、觉得我特别的那一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "f5126620aa6c8ade27b25b9ddc13b4f4740da759aa9e556887f2b92a9b532f29", "ja": "その日が、『アイドル・高山紗代子』の、\nバースデーだって言えると思うんです！", "zh": "我想，那一天就是“偶像高山纱代子”的生日！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "4cf6271c888d1206bda36b2cce08096699317083d5b9838828920c3c9d01cfa9", "ja": "みなさん、私に出会ってくれてありがとうございます！\n今日は、お祝いさせてください！", "zh": "大家，非常感谢你们能与我相遇！\n今天，就让我来为你们庆祝吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "61f98a4af322b12b1509efd66859e24eac3ee13d38467f7aca05809295d9d1c0", "ja": "それじゃみんな、せーので「おめでとう」！\nいくよー！？　せーのっ！", "zh": "那么大家，一起喊“恭喜”！\n要开始咯——！？预备——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1009_audience", "source_sha256": "068099da2063430d0d328172385af786cad821f30585eca7a85821598cd88bd9", "ja": "おめでとー！！！", "zh": "恭喜ーー！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "aecbb9f6fa9e716d33375a643685b972da5b0f9ffce30b0feb73b7aab64dda1b", "ja": "ありがとーっ！！！", "zh": "谢谢大家——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "de55a30c913a0bb6944aa72abf5706face86c0a62d9064c6f26ba1d47829db6c", "ja": "みなさん、私と出会ってくれて、\n私を好きになってくれて本当にありがとう！", "zh": "大家，能与我相遇，\n能喜欢上我，真的非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "474c5aa4976b975c3858dd970f7f59d5b0e4e0da9afc8c2e9836813d84ef050e", "ja": "これからも、みなさんと一緒に進んでいきたいです！\nどうか、応援よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "今后也想和大家一起走下去！\n还请大家继续支持我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1013_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "78973bec408d899a4f7a0350ff4c3e64018eeea70da509a5007a0b4196f99903", "ja": "紗代子ちゃん、お疲れさま！\nとっても、いいステージだったね……♪", "zh": "纱代子，辛苦了！真是场很棒的演出呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "28305e9d1cad993ea71fb2168c88af05b56777db01faf3c057901af68e66ddf3", "ja": "ファンの人たちも、とってもうれしそうでしたね。\nよかったぁ……♪", "zh": "粉丝们看起来也特别开心呢。\n太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "c8d3e171d76c120e11b8e3e3fb8e38ecc6a9ee9dc36c4808ce2a943e56c8b4b7", "ja": "わたしも、すっごく楽しかった！　でも紗代子さん、\n紗代子さんのファンの人は、これからもふえるよね？", "zh": "我也超级开心的！不过纱代子，\n纱代子的粉丝，今后也会继续增加吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "d47c23f22b48cb728d5047491dcdc15ca3220763bd4ac2512015920e11dffc00", "ja": "そうしたら、毎日お誕生日になっちゃわない？", "zh": "那样的话，不就每天都成生日了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "ef2a7b08c524f25d9859b3f7799cde9780f3b51ea581fde27a5beb33a3f9e7fa", "ja": "毎日お誕生日かぁ……ふふっ。\nそうなったら、最高だね！", "zh": "每天都是生日啊……呵呵。\n要是那样的话，可就太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f62981794001d6b9f490fdcef38e33e901bebd3e8a36122f8698f82d876e8934", "ja": "（紗代子の情熱がファンの人達に伝わっていたように、\nファンの人を思う優しい心もまた、伝わったはずだ）", "zh": "（纱代子的热情似乎传达给了粉丝们，而她对粉丝们的温柔心意，也一定传达到了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_129_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ef60ff3eda7127400dc53590e4128c3be33b04fb837d5e48c2b785af73563ec6", "ja": "（毎日が、誰かにとって紗代子と出会った\n記念すべき日……今日も、明日も、明後日も！）", "zh": "（每一天，对某个人来说，都是与纱代子相遇的\n值得纪念的日子……今天、明天、后天也一样！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
